<view class="page">
  <view class="hero-panel">
    <view class="eyebrow">文案风险体检</view>
    <view class="title">兼职文案体检</view>
    <view class="subtitle">粘贴你看到的副业或兼职广告，系统会识别可疑点。请勿粘贴身份证、银行卡、验证码等敏感信息。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="panel">
    <view class="section-title">
      <text>粘贴文案</text>
      <text class="muted">{{text.length}}/2000</text>
    </view>
    <textarea class="textarea" placeholder="例如：点赞关注日结，导师带单，下载APP做任务返佣..." value="{{text}}" bindinput="onTextInput" maxlength="2000" />
    <view class="button-row">
      <view class="ghost-button" bindtap="clearText">清空</view>
      <view class="primary-button" bindtap="scan">开始检测</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="panel">
    <view class="section-title">示例文案</view>
    <block wx:for="{{examples}}" wx:key="*this">
      <view class="example-card" data-text="{{item}}" bindtap="useExample">{{item}}</view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <view class="notice">
    检测结果只保存特征摘要，不保存原文。涉及转账、押金、下载陌生 App、银行卡或验证码时，先停止再核实。
  </view>
</view>
